    KYLISA @ talk "Entonces deberías-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:221
translate es qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_767c08bb:

    # "I heard a soft voice calling from inside the Church hall."
    "Oí una voz suave que venía del interior de la sala de la iglesia."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:222
translate es qst_NewMyu_4_findMyuChurch_8c646798:

    # MYU "It's okay..{i}*Sniff*{/i} It's him."
    MYU "Está bien.{i}*Snif*{/i} Es él."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheNewMyu/scr.rpy:223
